OL,3,GNEWSAResidents cry foul over 'fishy
OL,4,Asmell' in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents from a village in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire have complained they
OL,8,Fare being plagued by "a fishy smell".
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency has confirmed it
OL,11,Fis investigating the cause of "bad
OL,12,Fsmells" in Trowell and neighbouring
OL,13,FIlkeston in Derbyshire, and urged
OL,14,Fmembers of the public to report any
OL,15,Finstances.
OL,17,FDon Pringle, Broxtowe borough and
OL,18,FTrowell parish councillor, said issues
OL,19,Fwith smells in the area stretched back
OL,20,Fto the 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
